  project's schemas.
  Ajv depends on: fast-deep-equal 3.1.3 (MIT), fast-uri 3.1.9 (BSD-3-Clause),
  json-schema-traverse 1.0.0 (MIT), require-from-string 2.0.2 (MIT).
