  Its engine file wllama.wasm ships as model-libs/wllama.wasm, pinned by size and SHA-256. It is a
  WebAssembly build of llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp, MIT licence).
- @w3c/webmcp-polyfill 0.1.0, Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://github.com/w3c-oss/webmcp-polyfill
