Test and spike data
-------------------

fixtures/agsc-tools.json is the tool list that an AgenticSystemCore node page
registers through WebMCP, taken from the AgenticSystemCore engine
(src/distribution/mcp-tools.js), Apache License, Version 2.0.

AgenticSystemCore is a trademark of Andrei N. Besleaga. WebAIAssist is the browser client of the
AgenticSystemCore project, by the same author. It works with AgenticSystemCore nodes; it is not an
official WebMCP extension and has no connection with Google, W3C or any model publisher named in it.

Models
------

No model weights are part of this package. The user downloads them, on a click, from the addresses
and revisions listed in docs/MODEL-LICENCES.md, which also gives each publisher's licence statement.
